From u99a06696c483481a at groups.google.com  Thu Dec 20 14:18:11 2018
From: u99a06696c483481a at groups.google.com (Edward Rigdon)
Date: Thu, 20 Dec 2018 14:18:11 +0000
Subject: Re: error using WLSMV in moderated mediation analysis, ordinal dependent outcomes, continuous moderator
Message-ID: <m5KwU9-DRsc.kr_oeXObCAAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <m5KwU9-DRsc._WGM2sE3CwAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
